// Common Bitcoin Script Macros Library
// This file contains reusable macro definitions that can be imported into other scripts

// Duplicate and verify non-zero
// Usage: dup verify
// Result: Fails if top stack value is 0 or false

// Swap and drop second item
// Usage: swap drop
// Result: Removes second-from-top item, keeps top

// Triple the top stack value
// Usage: dup dup add add
// Stack: [x] -> [3x]
dup dup add add

// Square the top stack value
// Usage: dup mul
// Stack: [x] -> [x²]

// Check if value is in range [min, max]
// Stack before: [value, min, max]
// Stack after: [1 if in range, 0 otherwise]
// Usage: over over greaterThanOrEqual rot rot lessThanOrEqual and
